msgid "Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro"
msgstr "Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: beltoft-gift-cards-for-woocommerce-pro.php
msgid "https://beltoft.net/beltoft-gift-cards-pro"
msgstr "https://beltoft.net/beltoft-gift-cards-pro"

#. Description of the plugin
#: beltoft-gift-cards-for-woocommerce-pro.php
msgid "Premium add-on for Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce — scheduled delivery, email themes, store credit, bulk generation, BOGO promotions, and analytics. Requires the free core plugin."
msgstr "Extensão premium para o Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce — entrega agendada, temas de e-mail, crédito de loja, geração em massa, promoções BOGO e análises. Requer o plugin gratuito."

#. Author of the plugin
#: beltoft-gift-cards-for-woocommerce-pro.php
msgid "beltoft.net"
msgstr "beltoft.net"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: beltoft-gift-cards-for-woocommerce-pro.php
msgid "https://beltoft.net"
msgstr "https://beltoft.net"

#: beltoft-gift-cards-for-woocommerce-pro.php:48
#: beltoft-gift-cards-for-woocommerce-pro.php:88
msgid "Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requires the free \"Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce\" plugin to be installed and activated."
msgstr "O Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requer que o plugin gratuito \"Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce\" esteja instalado e ativo."

#: beltoft-gift-cards-for-woocommerce-pro.php:78
msgid "Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requires WooCommerce to be installed and activated."
msgstr "O Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requer que o WooCommerce esteja instalado e ativo."

#: beltoft-gift-cards-for-woocommerce-pro.php:98
msgid "Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requires version 1.2.0 or higher of the free plugin. Please update."
msgstr "O Smart Gift Cards for WooCommerce - Pro requer a versão 1.2.0 ou superior do plugin gratuito. Atualize por favor."

